## Citation

Gupta, D., Bartels, D. & Demner-Fushman, D. *A Dataset of Medical Questions Paired with
Automatically Generated Answers and Evidence-supported References.* Scientific Data 12,
1035 (2025). CC BY 4.0.

Download the raw file from https://osf.io/ydbzq/ and save it as `data/medaesqa_v1.json`.
It is not committed to this repo.
